# Frontend environment variables for Teashore.
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle.
#
# ── Local development ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Do NOT set VITE_API_BASE_URL locally.  Leave it absent or empty.
# The Vite dev-server proxy rewrites /api/* → http://127.0.0.1:8000/*
# so all API calls work without any environment variable.
#
# ── Production (Vercel) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set this in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
# Value: the Railway backend root URL — no trailing slash, NO /api suffix.
#
# CORRECT:   https://teashoresite-production.up.railway.app
# WRONG:     https://teashoresite-production.up.railway.app/api   ← adds /api twice
# WRONG:     https://teashoresite-production.up.railway.app/      ← trailing slash
#
# The api.js wrapper appends paths like /menu, /orders directly to this URL.
# The Railway backend mounts all routes at the root (e.g. GET /menu, POST /orders).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
